<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Lew says makes no claim against Coles.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Lew says makes no claim against Coles.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coles Myer Ltd deputy chairman Solomon Lew said on Friday that he was not making any legal claim against Coles Myer but confirmed he had applied to legally force the return of documents given to Coles by the Australian Securities Commission (ASC).</p>
<p>Lew and two officials from his investment company, Premier Investments Ltd, have applied to the Federal Court to compel the return of transcripts of their evidence given in the ASC's enquiry into the Yannon transaction.</p>
<p>&quot;Contrary to some suggestions, I am making no claim against Coles Myer Ltd,&quot; Lew said in a statement outlining the actions.</p>
</text>
